@startuml sl-03-return-settlement
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam roundcorner 6
skinparam conditionStyle inside

title Flow 3 — Unit Return, Win-Win Early Return & Final Settlement (Activity Swimlane)

|Storage Customer|
start
:Access My Units portal & select active rental contract;
:Initiate Unit Return workflow;
:Select requested return appointment date (BR-RET-01);

if (Return date is before contract end date?) then (early return)
  |Storage Customer|
  :Review Win-Win Early Return financial quote (BR-RET-06);
  note right
    **Win-Win Early Return Policy (BR-RET-06):**
    - 100% refund of unused future rental days
    - Forfeit 100% initial security deposit as penalty
  end note
  :Acknowledge terms and confirm early return submission;
else (standard return)
  |Storage Customer|
  :Confirm return schedule at contract maturity;
endif

|System|
:Create ReturnRequest record with status PENDING;
:Transition RentalContract status: ACTIVE -> PENDING_RETURN;
:Assign checkout inspection task to Facility Staff shift schedule;

|Storage Customer|
:Clear all personal belongings from storage unit;
:Meet Facility Staff at facility on scheduled return date;

|Facility Staff|
:Conduct exit inspection (check structural integrity, cleanliness, trash, damages) (BR-RET-04);
:Capture checkout inspection photos & record unit condition;

if (Unit has physical damage or extra cleaning required?) then (yes)
  :Log repair costs & extra cleaning charges as ContractExtraCharge (BR-RET-05);
else (clean & intact)
  :Confirm zero damage charges;
endif

:Submit final inspection report in system;

|System|
:Calculate final settlement balance:
Net Balance = Deposit - Damage Charges - Unpaid Penalties + Unused Rent (BR-RET-07);

|Facility Manager|
:Review ReturnRequest, inspection photos, and proposed settlement statement;
:Approve final settlement calculation (BR-RET-07);

|System|
:Revoke customer Smart Lock PIN & gate access credentials;
:Transition StorageUnit status: OCCUPIED -> CLEANING (BR-RET-09);
if (Net Balance > 0 (Refund to Customer)?) then (refund)
  :Queue bank transfer refund for remaining deposit balance (BR-RET-08);
  :Mark PaymentTransaction as PENDING_REFUND / SUCCESS;
else if (Net Balance < 0 (Customer owes money)?) then (debt)
  :Generate outstanding payment link for customer to pay shortfall;
  |Storage Customer|
  :Pay outstanding balance via VNPay Sandbox;
  |System|
endif

:Transition RentalContract status: PENDING_RETURN -> RETURNED -> CLOSED;
:Transition ReturnRequest status: PENDING -> COMPLETED;

|Facility Staff|
:Complete facility cleaning & sanitize unit;
|System|
:Transition StorageUnit status: CLEANING -> AVAILABLE (ready for re-rent) (BR-RET-09);

|Storage Customer|
:Receive final settlement statement & contract closure receipt;
stop
@enduml

